        "background": "page",
        "eyebrow": "Dried Petals Gallery",
        "heading": "Meet the creator",
        "body": "<p>Hello, I’m Thomas, founder of Dried Petals Gallery.</p><p>My love of flowers began in my grandmother’s garden. It was filled with quiet colour and life, and as a child I was drawn to the details — the shape of petals, the rhythm of leaves and the way flowers changed with the seasons. That connection to nature stayed with me.</p><p>Years later, pressing flowers became my way of preserving meaningful moments, slowing time and honouring beauty that would otherwise fade. What began as a personal practice grew into Dried Petals Gallery.</p><p>Today, every frame is handcrafted with care. Each petal is selected and arranged by hand to create a minimal, timeless piece designed to live beautifully in your home for years to come.</p>",
        "signature": "With gratitude, Thomas",
        "button_label": "Our story",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/our-story"
      }
    },
